==History==
2023
*The Little Prince was playable in the [[Tournament/Special Event Challenges|Mega Draft Challenge]] on 2/11/2023, before its release date, as an unintended glitch. Supercell fixed this glitch with a [[Version History#Maintenance Break (2/11/2023)|maintenance break]].
*The Little Prince [[Cards|card]] was generally released on 6/11/2023, in the [[Version History#Pass Royale and more (6/11/2023)|November 2023 Update]].
*On 13/11/2023, a [[Version History#Minor Update (13/11/2023)|Minor Update]], decreased the Royal Rescue's dash range to 4.5 tiles (from 5 tiles). It also fixed a bug where Royal Rescue could hit [[:Category:Troop Cards|troops]] underground and made it so that [[Clone]] no longer creates two full health Guardiennes when used at the right moment that Little Prince activates Royal Rescue.
*On 17/11/2023, a [[Version History#Maintenance Break (17/11/2023)|maintenance break]], increased the number of attacks required to change stages to 3 (from 2) and decreased the Royal Rescue's pushback to 2.5 tiles (from 3.5 tiles).
*On 14/12/2023, a [[Version History#Maintenance Break (14/12/2023)|maintenance break]], fixed a bug where the Little Prince's hit speed would not reset after moving.
2024
*On 3/1/2024, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (3/1/2024)|Balance Update]], decreased the Little Prince's damage by 9% and decreased the Guardienne's hitpoints by 11%.
*On 5/3/2024, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (5/3/2024)|Balance Update]], decreased the Little Prince’s range to 5.5 tiles (from 6 tiles). It also decreased the Royal Rescue’s dash range to 4 tiles (from 4.5 tiles).
*On 17/6/2024, the [[Version History#Goblin World Update (17/6/2024)|Goblin World Update]], decreased the Little Prince's hitpoints by 0.28% and his damage by 1%, decreased the Royal Rescue damage by 48.1%, its pushback to 2 tiles (from 2.5 tiles), increased Guardienne's first attack time interval to 0.5 seconds (from 0.2 seconds), and decreased her damage by 0.5%.
2025

*On 3/6/2025, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (3/6/2025)|Balance Update]], increased the Guardienne's damage by 1%. It also increased the Royal Rescue's damage by 11%.
*On 1/9/2025, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (3/6/2025)|Balance Update]], increased the Royal Rescue’s pushback to 2.5 tiles (from 2 tiles). It also increased the Royal Rescue’s damage by 11%.
*On 3/11/2025, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (3/6/2025)|Balance Update]], increased the Guardienne’s damage by 7%.

2026

*On 12/1/2026, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (12/1/2026)|Balance Update]], increased the Little Prince's damage by 5%.

